ẹ fún Fífi Àtúnṣe náà tún jẹ́ kí a ṣẹda àtúnṣe','Email designated Publishers when a %s is submitted'=>'Rán imeeli sí àwọn Olùtẹ́jáde tó yan nígbà tí a bá fi %s silẹ','Email designated Publishers when a %s is published'=>'Rán imeeli sí àwọn Olùtẹ́jáde tó yan nígbà tí a bá tẹ̀jáde %s','Email designated Publishers when a %s is approved'=>'Rán imeeli sí àwọn Olùtẹ́jáde tó yan nígbà tí a bá fọwọ́ sí %s','Email Editors and Administrators when a %s is submitted'=>'Rán imeeli sí àwọn Olùkọ́ àti Àwọn Alákóso nígbà tí a bá fi %s silẹ','Email Editors and Administrators when a %s is published'=>'Rán imeeli sí àwọn Olùkọ́ àti Àwọn Alákóso nígbà tí a bá tẹ̀jáde %s','Email Editors and Administrators when a %s is approved'=>'Rán imeeli sí àwọn Olùkọ́ àti Àwọn Alákóso nígbà tí a bá fọwọ́ sí %s','PublishPress Revisions Site Settings'=>'Ìṣètò Àtúnṣe PublishPress','These are the default settings for options which can be adjusted per-site.'=>'Eyi ni awọn eto aiyipada fun awọn aṣayan ti a le ṣe atunṣe fun oju-iwe kọọkan.','Use this tab to make NETWORK-WIDE changes to PublishPress Revisions settings. %s'=>'Lo taabu yii lati ṣe awọn ayipada KỌMỌ-WIDE si awọn eto PublishPress Revisions. %s','You can also specify %1$sdefaults for site-specific settings%2$s.'=>'O tun le tọka %1$s awọn aiyipada fun awọn eto pataki oju-iwe %2$s.','Here you can change the default value for settings which are controlled separately on each site.'=>'Nibi o le yi iye aiyipada pada fun awọn eto ti a n ṣakoso ni pataki lori oju-iwe kọọkan.','Note that %1$s network-wide settings%2$s may also be available.'=>'Ṣe akiyesi pe %1$s awọn eto kọmọọ-wiwo %2$s le tun wa.','License'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ','Past Revisions are earlier versions of a post.'=>'Awọn Atunṣe Ti tẹlẹ jẹ awọn ẹya iṣaaju ti ifiweranṣẹ kan.','This post type does not support Past Revisions.'=>'Iru ifiweranṣẹ yii ko ni atilẹyin fun Awọn Atunṣe Ti tẹlẹ.','New Revisions are changes which are not yet published.'=>'Awọn Atunṣe Tuntun jẹ awọn ayipada ti a ko ti gbejade sibẹsibẹ.','Note: Third party code may cause some post types to be incompatible with PublishPress Revisions.'=>'Ṣe akiyesi: Koodu ẹgbẹ kẹta le fa ki diẹ ninu awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ko baamu pẹlu PublishPress Revisions.','For Revisions integration on the Content Calendar, Overview and Content Board, please update %sPublishPress Planner Pro%s.'=>'Fun iṣọpọ Revisions lori Kalendaru Akọkọ, Atunyẹwo ati Iboju Akọkọ, jọwọ ṣe imudojuiwọn %sPublishPress Planner Pro%s.','Ready to enhance your revision workflow?'=>'Ṣetan lati mu ilọsiwaju ilana atunṣe rẹ pọ si?','Get PublishPress Statuses Pro and optimize your revision process with custom revision statuses.'=>'Gba PublishPress Statuses Pro ki o mu ilana atunṣe rẹ pọ si pẹlu awọn ipo atunṣe adani.','Define your own statuses before or after Revision Submitted'=>'Ṣe alaye awọn ipo tirẹ ṣaaju tabi lẹhin Atilẹyin Atunṣe','New predefined statuses: Deferred, Needs Work, Rejected'=>'Awọn ipo ti a ti ṣeto tẹlẹ tuntun: Ti a dawọ, Nbeere Iṣẹ, Ti kọ','Statuses can be specific to a post type'=>'Awọn ipo le jẹ pataki si iru ifiweranṣẹ kan','Control access to statuses per-role'=>'Ṣakoso wiwọle si awọn ipo ni ibamu si ipa','Status workflow can be nested with sub-statuses'=>'Ilana ipo le jẹ irọrun pẹlu awọn ipo-kekere','Get PublishPress Statuses Pro'=>'Gba PublishPress Statuses Pro','Learn More'=>'Kọ ẹkọ diẹ sii','Pro Plugin'=>'Pro Plugin','Install Statuses Pro to unlock custom revision statuses.'=>'Fi Statuses Pro sori lati tu awọn ipo atunṣe aṣa silẹ.','Configure for any post type and role to match your editing workflow.'=>'Ṣeto fun iru ifiweranṣẹ ati ipa eyikeyi lati ba ṣiṣatunkọ rẹ mu.','Get Statuses Pro'=>'Gba Statuses Pro','Maximum revisions per post:'=>'Iye to pọ julọ ti atunṣe fun ifiweranṣẹ:','(unlimited)'=>'(aimọ)','Note that archiving can also be disabled by %1$sPost Type%2$s.'=>'Ṣe akiyesi pe a tun le pa arọwọto silẹ nipasẹ %1$sPost Type%2$s.','%s capability'=>'%s agbara','Assign capability to roles'=>'Fi agbara le awọn ipa','Prevent non-Administrators from restoring a revision without the %s.'=>'Dena awọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso lati tun pada si atunṣe laisi %s.','Prevent non-Administrators from restoring a revision without the restore_revisions capability'=>'Dena awọn ti kii ṣe Alakoso lati tun pada si atunṣe laisi agbara restore_revisions','Modification Date'=>'Ọjọ Iṣatunkọ','Revision Creation'=>'Ṣẹda Atunṣe','Submission'=>'If submission','Scheduling'=>'Iṣeto','Publication'=>'Ìtẹjade','Management'=>'Iṣakoso','Create Revision capabilities'=>'Ṣẹda awọn agbara atunṣe','Assign capabilities to roles'=>'Fi awọn agbara le awọn ipa','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require %s.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le satunkọ ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere %s.','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require Create Revision capabilities (copy_posts, copy_others_pages, etc.)'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere awọn agbara Ṣẹda Atunṣe (copy_posts, copy_others_pages, ati bẹbẹ lọ)','To expand the Pages list, assign %s.'=>'Lati fa akojọ awọn Oju-iwe, yan %s.','Listing capabilities'=>'Awọn agbara atokọ','To expand the Pages list, assign Listing capabilities (list_others_pages, list_published_posts, etc.)'=>'Lati fa akojọ awọn Oju-iwe, yan Awọn agbara Atokọ (list_others_pages, list_published_posts, ati bẹbẹ lọ)','This plugin introduces a new user role, "Revisor."'=>'Eyi jẹ plugin ti o ṣe ifihan ipa olumulo tuntun, "Revisor."','Revision by a user who does not have the %s will cause all custom html tags to be stripped out.'=>'Atunṣe nipasẹ olumulo ti ko ni %s yoo fa ki gbogbo awọn tag html aṣa jẹ yọkuro.','Revision by a user who does not have the unfiltered_html capability will cause all custom html tags to be stripped out.'=>'Atunṣe nipasẹ olumulo ti ko ni agbara unfiltered_html yoo fa ki gbogbo awọn tag html aṣa jẹ yọkuro.','Broadest compat including Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder'=>'Ibaraenisepo jakejado pẹlu Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder','Standard storage schema for broadest 3rd party compat'=>'Iwe ipamọ boṣewa fun ibaraenisepo jakejado ti awọn ẹgbẹ kẹta','Enhanced Revision access control with PublishPress plugins'=>'Iṣakoso iraye si Atunṣe ti a mu pọ si pẹlu awọn plugins PublishPress','In enhanced mode, a Revision\'s status is stored by standard WordPress schema. Some plugins are incompatible.'=>'Ninu ipo ti a mu pọ si, ipo Atunṣe ni a fipamọ nipasẹ iwe eto WordPress boṣewa. Diẹ ninu awọn plugins ko ba ara wọn mu.','Prevent Revision creation if the post already has another Revision in progress.'=>'Dena ẹda Atunṣe ti ifiweranṣẹ ba ti ni Atunṣe miiran ti n lọ.','Work around cache plugin conflicts by requerying for revisions before suppressing the New Revision link.'=>'Yago fun awọn ariyanjiyan plugin cache nipa tun beere fun awọn atunṣe ṣaaju ki o to dinku ọna asopọ Atunṣe Tuntun.','If the user does not have a regular Edit link, recaption the %s link as "Edit."'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba ni ọna asopọ Ṣatunkọ deede, tun orukọ ọna asopọ %s gẹgẹbi "Ṣatunkọ."','Default labels are "Not Submitted for Approval", "Submitted for Approval", "Scheduled Revision"'=>'Awọn aami aiyipada ni "Ko ti fi ranṣẹ fun Ijẹrisi", "Ti fi ranṣẹ fun Ijẹrisi", "Atunṣe ti a gbero"','Enable published content to be copied, edited, submitted for approval and managed on the %sNew Revisions%s screen.'=>'Mu ki akoonu ti a tẹjade le ṣee daakọ, ṣe atunṣe, fi ranṣẹ fun ijẹrisi ati ṣakoso lori iboju %sNew Revisions%s.','Submit Revision capabilities'=>'Fi agbara Atunṣe ranṣẹ','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require Submit Revision capabilities (revise_posts, revise_others_pages, etc.)'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le ṣe atunṣe ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere awọn agbara Fi Atunṣe ranṣẹ (revise_posts, revise_others_pages, ati bẹbẹ lọ)','When a %s is published, update post publish date to current time.'=>'Nigbati %s ba ti tẹjade, ṣe imudojuiwọn ọjọ ifiweranṣẹ si akoko lọwọlọwọ.','When a %s is published, update post modified date to current time.'=>'Nigbati %s ba ti tẹjade, ṣe imudojuiwọn ọjọ ti a ṣe atunṣe si akoko lọwọlọwọ.','When a new revision is created by any user who is allowed to submit revisions, automatically submit it.'=>'Nígbà tí a bá ṣẹda atunṣe tuntun nipasẹ ẹnikẹni ti a gba laaye lati fi atunṣe silẹ, fi silẹ laifọwọyi.','Auto-submit revisions if the user can directly edit the main post.'=>'Fi atunṣe silẹ laifọwọyi ti olumulo ba le satunkọ ifiweranṣẹ akọkọ taara.','This allows immediate approval within the Compare screen. If disabled, a Preview link is provided instead.'=>'Eyi gba a laaye fun ìmúdájú lẹsẹkẹsẹ ninu iboju Àfihàn. Ti a ba pa a, a fi ọna asopọ Àfihàn silẹ dipo.','If a currently published post or page is edited and a future date set, the change will not be applied until the selected date.'=>'Ti a bá satunkọ ifiweranṣẹ tabi oju-iwe ti a tẹjade lọwọlọwọ ki a si ṣeto ọjọ iwaju, ayipada naa ko ni lo titi di ọjọ ti a yan.','Publish scheduled revisions using the WP-Cron mechanism. On some sites, publication will fail if this setting is disabled.'=>'Ṣe atẹjade atunṣe ti a ṣeto nipa lilo ilana WP-Cron. Lori diẹ ninu awọn aaye, atẹjade yoo kuna ti a ba pa iṣeto yii.','Publish scheduled revisions asynchronously, via a secondary http request from the server.  This is usually best since it eliminates delay, but some servers may not support it.'=>'Ṣe atẹjade atunṣe ti a ṣeto ni asiko, nipasẹ ibeere http keji lati ọdọ olupin. Eyi jẹ deede ti o dara julọ nitori o yọkuro idaduro, ṣugbọn diẹ ninu awọn olupin le ma ṣe atilẹyin rẹ.','The WP-Cron trigger is disabled, but scheduled tasks are still excecuted using a custom trigger.'=>'Iṣelọpọ WP-Cron ti wa ni pa, ṣugbọn awọn iṣẹ ti a ṣeto ṣi wa ni ṣiṣe nipa lilo iṣelọpọ aṣa.','Caption the button as either "Approve and Publish" or "Approve and Schedule."'=>'Pe bọtini naa gẹgẹbi "Fọwọsi ati Ṣe Atẹjade" tabi "Fọwọsi ati Ṣeto."','This may improve compatibility with some plugins.'=>'Eyi le mu ibamu pọ pẹlu diẹ ninu awọn afikun.','Control New Revisions access with the %s.'=>'Ṣakoso iraye si Atunṣe Tuntun pẹlu %s.','Control New Revisions access with the manage_revision_queue capability.'=>'Ṣakoso iraye si Atunṣe Tuntun pẹlu agbara manage_revision_queue.','Users will need the %s to edit others\' Unsubmitted Revisions.'=>'Awọn olumulo yoo nilo %s lati satunkọ Atunṣe ti a ko fi silẹ ti awọn miiran.','Users will need the manage_unsubmitted_revisions capability to edit others\' Unsubmitted Revisions.'=>'Awọn olumulo yoo nilo agbara manage_unsubmitted_revisions lati satunkọ Atunṣe ti a ko fi silẹ ti awọn miiran.','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require the %s.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le satunkọ ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere %s.','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require the edit_others_revisions capability.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le satunkọ ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere agbara edit_others_revisions.','If the user can\'t edit the published post, require the list_others_revisions capability.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le satunkọ ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade, beere agbara list_others_revisions.','Bypass the above restrictions for others\' revisions to logged in user\'s own posts.'=>'Ṣe ayẹwo awọn ihamọ loke fun atunṣe awọn miiran si awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti olumulo ti o wọle.','Regenerate "post has revision" flags'=>'Tun ṣẹda awọn asia "ifiranṣẹ ni atunṣe"','Apply this maintenance operation if Has Revision labels on Posts / Pages screens mismatch the New Revisions listing.'=>'Lo iṣẹ itọju yii ti awọn aami Has Revision lori awọn iboju Ifiweranṣẹ / Oju-iwe ko baamu pẹlu atokọ Atunṣe Tuntun.','For enhanced notifications, install %sPublishPress Planner%s.'=>'Fun awọn iwifunni ti o ni ilọsiwaju, fi %sPublishPress Planner%s sori ẹrọ.','For enhanced notifications, update %sPublishPress Planner%s.'=>'Fun awọn ikilọ ti o ni ilọsiwaju, ṣe imudojuiwọn %sPublishPress Planner%s.','Send revision action notifications using the customizable %1$sPublishPress Planner Notifications system%2$s.'=>'Firanṣẹ awọn ikilọ igbasilẹ atunṣe nipa lilo eto %1$sPublishPress Planner Notifications%2$s ti o le ṣe akanṣe.','Upgrade to Revisions Pro to send revision action notifications using the customizable %1$sPublishPress Planner Notifications system%2$s.'=>'Gbadun si Revisions Pro lati firanṣẹ awọn ikilọ igbasilẹ atunṣe nipa lilo eto %1$sPublishPress Planner Notifications%2$s ti o le ṣe akanṣe.','Users matching Planner > Notifications configuration get revision notifications only if they can edit the published post.'=>'Awọn olumulo ti o baamu iṣeto Planner > Notifications gba awọn ikilọ atunṣe nikan ti wọn ba le ṣatunkọ ifiweranṣẹ ti a tẹjade.','Never'=>'K nunca','By default'=>'Nipasẹ aiyipada','Always'=>'Nigbagbogbo','select recipients'=>'yan awọn olugba','To avoid notification failures, buffer emails for delayed sending once minute, hour or day limits are exceeded'=>'Lati yago fun awọn ikuna ikilọ, fi awọn imeeli pamọ fun fifiranṣẹ pẹ, lẹẹkan a ti kọja awọn aala iṣẹju, wakati tabi ọjọ','Notification Buffer'=>'Ibufe Ikilọ','Notification Log'=>'Iwe itan Ikilọ','Purge Notification Buffer'=>'Purge Ibufe Ikilọ','Truncate Notification Log'=>'Dinku Iwe itan Ikilọ','Sent in last minute: %d / %d'=>'Firanṣẹ ni iṣẹju to kọja: %d / %d','Sent in last hour: %d / %d'=>'Firanṣẹ ni wakati to kọja: %d / %d','Sent in last day: %d / %d'=>'Firanṣẹ ni ọjọ to kọja: %d / %d','Seconds until next buffer processing time: %d'=>'Awọn aaya titi de akoko ṣiṣe ibufe ti n bọ: %d','Show Notification Log / Buffer'=>'Fihan Iwe itan Ikilọ / Ibufe','Show with message content'=>'Fihan pẹlu akoonu ifiranṣẹ','Ready to enhance your revision notifications?'=>'Ṣetan lati mu awọn ikilọ atunṣe rẹ pọ si?','Upgrade to Revisions Pro for integration with our PublishPress Planner Notifications framework.'=>'Gba igbesoke si Revisions Pro fun isopọ pẹlu ilana PublishPress Planner Notifications wa.','Customize notification message and subject'=>'Ṣe akanṣe ifiranṣẹ ikilọ ati koko-ọrọ','Notify for a specific post type, category or term'=>'Kilọ fun iru ifiweranṣẹ kan, ẹka tabi ọrọ','Target specific roles, users, or user groups'=>'Fojusi awọn ipa pataki, awọn olumulo, tabi awọn ẹgbẹ olumulo','With PublishPress Planner Pro, send notifications to a Slack channel'=>'Pẹlu PublishPress Planner Pro, firanṣẹ awọn ikilọ si ikanni Slack','Pro Feature'=>'Ẹya Pro','Upgrade to Revisions Pro to unlock Planner Notifications integration.'=>'Gba igbesoke si Revisions Pro lati ṣii isopọ Planner Notifications.','Customize notification content and recipients for each notification type.'=>'Ṣe akanṣe akoonu ikilọ ati awọn olugba fun ọkọọkan awọn iru ikilọ.','Some themes may block revision preview.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn akori le dènà iwoye atunṣe.','Published Post Slug'=>'Slug Ifiweranṣẹ Ti a tẹjade','Revision Slug'=>'Slug Atunṣe','Revision ID only'=>'ID Atunṣe nikan','Some themes or plugins may require Revision Slug or Revision ID link type for proper template loading and field display.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn akori tabi awọn afikun le nilo Slug Atunṣe tabi ID Atunṣe iru ọna asopọ fun ikojọpọ awoṣe to pe ati ifihan aaye.','The revision preview argument is configured by constant definition: %s'=>'Argument iwoye atunṣe ti wa ni iṣeto nipasẹ itumọ iduroṣinṣin: %s','Adjust preview links to use "rv_preview" argument instead of "preview". Experiment to see which works best with your theme.'=>'Ṣatunṣe awọn ọna asopọ iwoye lati lo "rv_preview" argument dipo "preview". Ṣe idanwo lati rii eyi ti o dara julọ pẹlu akori rẹ.','Some themes may require this setting for correct revision preview display.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn akori le nilo eto yii fun ifihan iwoye atunṣe to pe.','This should usually be enabled, except to work around conflicts with other another plugin\'s postmeta data.'=>'Eyi yẹ ki o jẹ ki a mu ṣiṣẹ nigbagbogbo, ayafi lati yago fun awọn ariyanjiyan pẹlu data postmeta ti afikun miiran.','If the user can\'t publish, require the %s to edit others\' unpublished Posts.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le tẹjade, beere %s lati ṣe atunṣe awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti ko ti tẹjade ti awọn miiran.','If the user can\'t publish, require the edit_others_drafts capability to edit others\' unpublished Posts.'=>'Ti olumulo ko ba le tẹjade, beere agbara edit_others_drafts lati ṣe atunṣe awọn Ifiweranṣẹ ti ko ti tẹjade ti awọn miiran.','If post-specific permissions restrict or expand access to a post, apply those permissions to its revisions also.'=>'Ti awọn igbanilaaye pato ifiweranṣẹ ba dènà tabi fa iraye si ifiweranṣẹ kan, lo awọn igbanilaaye wọnyẹn si awọn atunṣe rẹ paapaa.','Rank Math SEO may prevent Revision update on some sites.'=>'Rank Math SEO le ṣe idiwọ imudojuiwọn atunṣe lori diẹ ninu awọn aaye.','WPML Translation Management'=>'Iṣakoso Itumọ WPML','Sync "Needs Update" flags'=>'Sopọ "Nilo Imudojuiwọn" awọn asia','Set "Needs Update" for any post with translations which was updated (possibly by revision approval) more recently than its translations.'=>'Ṣeto "Nilo Imudojuiwọn" fun eyikeyi ifiweranṣẹ pẹlu awọn itumọ ti a ṣe imudojuiwọn (boya nipasẹ gbigba atunṣe) laipẹ ju awọn itumọ rẹ lọ.','Show descriptive captions for PublishPress Revisions settings.'=>'Fihan awọn akọle apejuwe fun awọn eto Atunṣe PublishPress.','Plugin settings, New Revisions contents and related data will be deleted, but only after the last copy of Revisions / Revisions Pro is deleted.'=>'Awọn eto amugbalegbe, Awọn akoonu Atunṣe Tuntun ati data ti o ni ibatan yoo parẹ, ṣugbọn nikan lẹhin ti ẹda ti o kẹhin ti Atunṣe / Atunṣe Pro ti parẹ.','Unlock Pro Integrations'=>'Tu awọn iṣọpọ Pro silẹ','Upgrade to the Pro version for optimal compatibility and prompt, professional support.'=>'Gba ẹya Pro lati ni ibamu ti o dara julọ ati atilẹyin to rọọrun, ọjọgbọn.','Admin'=>'Alakoso','Builder'=>'Oludasilẹ','Cache'=>'Cache','E-Commerce'=>'Iṣowo E','Fields'=>'Awọn aaye','Multilingual'=>'Ẹya pupọ','SEO'=>'SEO','Workflow'=>'Ilana iṣẹ','Specify which PublishPress Revisions Settings to control network-wide. Unselected settings are controlled separately on each site.'=>'Ṣalaye iru awọn Eto Atunṣe PublishPress lati ṣakoso ni gbogbo nẹtiwọọki. Awọn eto ti a ko yan ni a ṣakos